    {
      "id": "knowhow-TIP-20261017-276b91a8d7317404-001",
      "type": "knowhow",
      "title": "1) 命令写在不可达的条件块里（死码）",
      "summary": "`DUMP_LISTS` 加进引擎时被写进 `if (cmd == \"WPF_DUMP\" || cmd == \"DUMP_COMBOS\" || cmd == \"XLATE_BATCH\")` 块**内部** → 外层条件永远不匹配，调用只会得到 `Unknown command`。 **教训**：给引擎加探针命令后必须**真的调用一次**并看返回——\"代码里有\"不等于\"命令能跑\"。 误判代价：上一轮把\"没命中\"解释成\"这个对话框不是 WinForms 列表\"，结论是错的。",
      "tags": [
        "session-knowledge",
        "manual",
        "promoted",
        "tip"
      ],
      "status": "active",
      "created": "2026-10-17T12:10:26.412Z",
      "updated": "2026-10-17T12:10:26.412Z",
      "scope": null,
      "category": "general",
      "specCategory": null,
      "createdBy": null,
      "sourceRef": "evidence:session:ksyn-2107ce852f0cfe00,src/engine/CMOLocalizer.cs:5056,src/engine/CMOLocalizer.cs:5723,scripts/verify_regressions.py:390,docs/BUG_REGISTRY.md:561",
      "parent": "knowhow-tip-20261017-276b91a8d7317404",
